OL,3,AUK borrows more than expected in July
OL,4,Aas Healey prepares for first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government borrowed slightly more
OL,7,Fthan expected in July, according to
OL,8,Ffigures published as Chancellor John
OL,9,FHealey draws up his first Budget.
OL,11,FThe Office for National Statistics
OL,12,F(ONS) said borrowing was #2.3bn more
OL,13,Fthan official forecasts from the Office
OL,14,Ffor Budget Responsibility (OBR).
OL,16,FBorrowing, the gap between what the
OL,17,Fgovernment spends and what it takes in
OL,18,Ftax receipts, was #1.8bn in July, two
OL,19,Fthirds higher than the same month last
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
